{"$1 events · fetched $2":"$1개 · $2 가져옴","$1 events · file":"$1개 · 파일","$1 h $2 min":"$1시간 $2분","$1 km":"$1 km","$1 m":"$1 m","$1 min":"$1분","$1: $2":"$1: $2","Add":"추가","Add a calendar":"캘린더 추가","Add an iCal link or an .ics file in Settings to see your events here.":"설정에서 iCal 링크나 .ics 파일을 추가하면 여기에 일정이 표시됩니다.","All day":"종일","Allow location access or enter a place in Settings to see sunrise and sunset.":"일출·일몰을 보려면 위치 접근을 허용하거나 설정에서 장소를 입력하세요.","Apply":"적용","Astronomical":"천문","Azimuth":"방위각","Calendar data by himekuri (MIT). Sun and Moon from Meeus / Schlyter low-precision theory (≈1 minute). Elevation: Open-Meteo, GSI.":"달력 데이터 himekuri(MIT). 태양과 달은 Meeus / Schlyter 저정밀 이론(약 1분). 해발고도: Open-Meteo, GSI.","Calendars (iCal)":"캘린더(iCal)","Change…":"변경…","Civil":"시민","Correct sunrise and sunset for horizon dip":"일출·일몰에 지평선 하강 보정 적용","Could not get your location ($1).":"위치를 가져올 수 없습니다($1).","Daily calendar":"일력 달력","Daily calendar — himekuri":"일력 달력 — himekuri","Day":"일","Day length":"낮 길이","Declination $1 · equation of time $2 min":"적위 $1 · 균시차 $2분","Distance":"거리","Done":"완료","Elevation":"해발고도","Elevation (m)":"해발고도(m)","Enter a latitude between −90 and 90 and a longitude between −180 and 180.":"위도는 −90~90, 경도는 −180~180 사이로 입력하세요.","Enter an https:// or webcal:// address.":"https:// 또는 webcal:// 주소를 입력하세요.","Entered by hand":"직접 입력","Events":"일정","First quarter":"상현","Full moon":"망(보름달)","GPS altitude":"GPS 고도","GSI DEM10B (10 m)":"GSI DEM10B(10 m)","GSI DEM5A (5 m)":"GSI DEM5A(5 m)","GSI global DEM (1 km)":"GSI 전구 DEM(1 km)","Getting your location…":"위치 가져오는 중…","Horizon dip from $1 m elevation: $2. At sea level sunrise would be $3 and sunset $4.":"해발 $1 m에 따른 지평선 하강 $2. 해수면이라면 일출 $3, 일몰 $4.","Horizon dip is off (times are for sea level).":"지평선 하강 보정이 꺼져 있습니다(해수면 기준).","Illumination":"위상(밝은 비율)","Import an .ics file":".ics 파일 가져오기","Last quarter":"하현","Latitude":"위도","Location":"위치","Location access was denied.":"위치 접근이 거부되었습니다.","Location access was not granted — s